# Replace this file's contents with the public key of the load-test / CI client
# that will reach the builders over ssh-ng://nixremote@<host>.
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored by sshd, so an unpopulated file authorizes
# no keys (the builder is still reachable for provisioning via its root key).
#
# Example:
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nza... ci-builder
